{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさーん♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ブログ久々の更新になっちゃって\nごめんなさい(>_<)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ここ数週間はかなり濃い〜日々を\n過ごしてましたヽ(｡･ω･｡)ﾉ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あんなの撮ったり、\nこんなの着たり、\nあれを覚えたり、\nマカロン食べたり...(OωO )♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"撮影で美味しいマカロンを\nいただいて、それはそれは美味しく\n食させて頂きました∩^ω^∩"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あぁマカロンってすごいなぁ\n本当に人生の最後の晩餐は\n食べきれないくらいのデッカい\nマカロンタワーにしてもらおう♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"よろしくね♪誰かっ♡（笑）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いや、マカロンだけ\n食べてたわけじゃなく\nちゃんと稽古や撮影してたから\nご安心を（笑）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"二期生を引き連れる秋元さん"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/manatsu.akimoto/img/files/46/_pre/blog/manatsu.akimoto/img/2014/05/29/7509342/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"だだんっ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/manatsu.akimoto/img/files/46/_pre/blog/manatsu.akimoto/img/2014/05/29/7509342/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"だだだんっ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/manatsu.akimoto/img/files/46/_pre/blog/manatsu.akimoto/img/2014/05/29/7509342/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"だだだだんっ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さて、どこかにアノ有名な\n一期生が紛れ込んでるんだけど\nわかったかなぁ？（笑）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ぬゅんっ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/manatsu.akimoto/img/files/46/_pre/blog/manatsu.akimoto/img/2014/05/29/7509342/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「ぬ」に小さい「ゅ」って\n何て読むんだろ？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ぬゅ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"結果的に"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"にゅ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"と一緒なのかなぁ？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ほら！小さい声でいいから"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ぬゅ     と      にゅ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"って言ってみて♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"一緒な感じしない？ヽ(〃v〃)ﾉ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"んー、自分で書いときながら\n結構気になる。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そんなことはさておき、\n放送されたてホヤホヤの\n楽天スーパーセールのCMに\n10福神で出させて\nいただいてますっ\\( ^^)/♡\\(^^ )/"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"やっぱりこうやって\nメディアに出る機会を\nもらえることは本当に貴重だし\nありがたいことです☆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"♪買〜えば買うほど\nポイントアップ〜♪\nなので6/1までに買いたいもの\n探そーっと∩^ω^∩"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちなみにもうエントリー\nできるみたいだったから私も\nもうエントリーしたよ♡（笑）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさんもお見逃しなくっ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あっ♪電車の中吊り広告にも\nストレートツインテールの\n私がいるから探してみてね/(｡･ω･｡)\\"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/manatsu.akimoto/img/files/46/_pre/blog/manatsu.akimoto/img/2014/05/29/7509342/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"生駒里奈(18)に遊ばれる"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/manatsu.akimoto/img/files/46/_pre/blog/manatsu.akimoto/img/2014/05/29/7509342/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"秋元真夏(20)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"（あと3ヶ月弱で21歳）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"バタバタ毎日を過ごしていましたが\nプリンシパルtroisはもう明日！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いやぁ、前回よりも\nなんだか切羽詰まってたけど\nとにかく笑いの絶えない\n稽古でした∩^ω^∩"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"日々学ぶこともたくさん。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"福田さんの作品面白くて\n大好きで今も新解釈・日本史\n観てるんだ〜(∩^ω^∩)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ムロツヨシさん面白いっ♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"一度スパカン！っていう\nムロツヨシさんのラジオに\n出させていただいたことが\nあるんだけどその時も初対面とは\n思えないほどすごく話しやすい方で\n安心してたくさん喋りました\\(^^)/"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"っってかなり話がそれた〜！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そうそう、プリンシパル。\n明日が初日！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"前回苦戦したからこそ、\n怖いし緊張するしすごく楽しみ♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"緊張と楽しさが共存してる\n状態ってすごく素敵だなぁって\n思うんだヽ(｡･ω･｡)ﾉ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"コメディ×自分らしさで\nがんばるぞーっっ☆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさんが笑顔になれる舞台を\nみんなで作れますように(((っ･ω･)っ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/manatsu.akimoto/img/files/46/_pre/blog/manatsu.akimoto/img/2014/05/29/7509342/0006.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"肩出し兄弟♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"9thの制作も終盤に差し掛かって\nるんだけど表題はすごく夏らしくて\nいろんなことに挑戦したくなる\nようなノリノリの曲なんだよ〜♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"車で流しながら海に行ったり\nテンションあげたい時に\nお家で聴いたりするのにも\nピッタリだと思う♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"夏ソンって素敵っ♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして今回は個人PVも\nあるのですっΣ(σ`･ω･´)σ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今回のはね、私としては\n珍しいことにも挑戦してます☆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"9thの握手会でリクエスト\nされそうだなぁ（笑）なんて\n思ったりもしました_(┐「ε:)_♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もちろんやりますけど｀‐ω‐´)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"といっても何のこっちゃ\nわからんと思うので公開されるのを\n暫しお待ちください♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"撮影本当に楽しかった(∩^ω^∩)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/manatsu.akimoto/img/files/46/_pre/blog/manatsu.akimoto/img/2014/05/29/7509342/0007.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最近美彩先輩に恐ろしく\nいじられるよ（笑）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本当に恐ろしく（笑）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最後にみなさんにお詫びが...\n毎月恒例でやっているお誕生日企画の\n手作りバースデーケーキ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今月の分を作る時間を\n見つけられなくてプリンシパル後に\nなっちゃいそうなんです(ToT)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"5月生まれの方や\n楽しみにしてくれてる方\nお待たせしちゃってごめんなさい。\nでも必ず5月の分と6月の分\n別々にお祝いさせてもらうので\n待っていてくれたら嬉しいです♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"よし！\nじゃあ明日からプリンシパル"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"猛ダッシュだーーーー！！！"}],"source":"archive"}